            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "(A woman carries away the used cups and saucers.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u002",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குணரத்தனம்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d001",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 12,
            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "Then I'm happy. The seventh is an auspicious day... ... ...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u003",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 12,
            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "What does it matter what day it is!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குணரத்தனம்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 12,
            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "No, madam! I have a little faith in auspicious days and stars.",
        "notes": [
          "`நாள் நக்ஷத்திரம்` is retained as the source's paired astrological reference to day and star rather than reduced to stars alone."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u005",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 12,
            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "All right, all right... ... so what!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "தங்கம்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 12,
            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "Why haven't you married, dear... ... ...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u007",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d006",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 12,
            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "I'm the one responsible for this family, aren't I? My younger brother was brought up in comfort; Father and Mother ordered that the family's hardships should not be placed on him. My elder sister's daughter, who has no father or mother, is studying in Madras; I am her support.",
        "notes": [
          "`சென்னை` is rendered as `Madras` in this 1953-period English derivative; the canonical Tamil remains unchanged."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u008",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குணரத்தனம்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d007",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 12,
            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "It is because you stand by everyone like a mother that they are looking for a life-partner for you who will live here with the household!...... ...",
        "notes": [
          "The source refers to a husband who would remain in Poomalai's household; no modern family-law terminology is added."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u009",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "தங்கம்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d008",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 12,
            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "Oh dear...you won't find a husband like that... the girl is like Lakshmi herself!",
        "notes": [
          "The source comparison to `லக்ஷிமி` is translated without normalizing the Tamil record."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u010",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 12,
            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Paranthaman enters, bathed and dressed.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u011",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d009",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 12,
            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "Come, brother! Do you know these people? (Paranthaman stares blankly.) Oh! Looks as though you know only their daughter... ... Bama's parents!.",
        "notes": [
          "The embedded source action remains inside the dialogue unit because it is part of the immutable dialogue record."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u012",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d010",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 12,
            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "Oh! Greetings!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u013",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d011",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 12,
            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "They've come to settle the marriage! Well... ... you agree, don't you... ... ...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u014",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 12,
            "printedPage": 4
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Paranthaman is silent, bashful.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u015",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குணரத்தனம்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d012",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 13,
            "printedPage": 5
          }
        ],
        "text": "Why even ask him that! Is there a child who says it doesn't want a banana?",
        "notes": [
          "The earlier English introduced extra broken wording not present in the corrected Tamil; this unit now follows the complete source sentence."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u016",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d013",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 13,
            "printedPage": 5
          }
        ],
        "text": "What do you say, Paranthama!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u017",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d014",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 13,
            "printedPage": 5
          }
        ],
        "text": "All right, Akka!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s004-u018",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குணரத்தனம்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s004-d015",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 13,
            "printedPage": 5
          }
        ],
        "text": "Then it's settled. We'll be going. I'm happy. We'll attend to what has to be done.",
        "notes": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
